1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,240
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? Yaponiyaning yozgi taomlari haqida.

2
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,740
1-qism: Nagashi somen (oqimli noodle)dan qanday zavqlanish kerak / Nagashi Somen (oqimli noodle)ni qanday iste’mol qilish kerak

3
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:14,974
Bu togʻlar orasidagi doʻkon ekan.

4
00:00:14,997 --> 00:00:18,091
Juda salqin ekan-ku.

5
00:00:18,114 --> 00:00:21,548
Daryo suvi toza ekan.

6
00:00:21,571 --> 00:00:26,248
Qarang, bambuk bor-ku.

7
00:00:26,271 --> 00:00:30,238
Bu nagashi somen ekan.

8
00:00:30,261 --> 00:00:32,927
Qiziqarli koʻrinadi.

9
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:36,350
Qoshiqni olib, kutaylik.

10
00:00:36,373 --> 00:00:39,445
A, somen kelyapti-ku.

11
00:00:39,469 --> 00:00:43,127
Vay, juda tez ekan.

12
00:00:43,151 --> 00:00:47,219
A, oʻtib ketdi.

13
00:00:47,243 --> 00:00:51,055
Qiyin ekan, tuta olmayapman.

14
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:53,212
Kuting.

15
00:00:53,235 --> 00:00:55,702
Yana keladi-ku.

16
00:00:55,725 --> 00:00:58,691
A, yana kelayapti.

17
00:00:58,714 --> 00:01:00,785
Shoshiling.

18
00:01:00,809 --> 00:01:04,709
A, yana oʻtib ketdi.

19
00:01:04,732 --> 00:01:07,622
Diqqatingizni jamlang.

20
00:01:07,645 --> 00:01:10,491
Suv juda tez oqayapti.

21
00:01:10,515 --> 00:01:13,766
Endi men sinab koʻray.

22
00:01:13,790 --> 00:01:15,926
Omadingizni sinab koʻring.

23
00:01:15,949 --> 00:01:17,683
Kelyapti.

24
00:01:17,706 --> 00:01:20,725
A, tutib oldim-ku.

25
00:01:20,748 --> 00:01:23,220
Ajoyib!

26
00:01:23,244 --> 00:01:24,982
Juda yaxshi qilyapsiz.

27
00:01:25,005 --> 00:01:28,544
Sousga botirib yeyish kerak.

28
00:01:28,567 --> 00:01:30,967
Juda mazali ekan.

29
00:01:30,990 --> 00:01:34,123
Men ham yeyishni xohlayapman.

30
00:01:34,146 --> 00:01:37,113
Keyin albatta tutib olaman.

31
00:01:37,136 --> 00:01:39,269
Kelyapti-ku.

32
00:01:39,292 --> 00:01:41,580
Oʻng tomondan kelayapti.

33
00:01:41,603 --> 00:01:44,570
Yaxshi, tutib oldim.

34
00:01:44,593 --> 00:01:46,926
Bajardingiz!

35
00:01:46,949 --> 00:01:49,194
Tabriklayman!

36
00:01:49,217 --> 00:01:51,584
Juda xursandman.

37
00:01:51,607 --> 00:01:54,852
Juda sovuq va mazali ekan.

38
00:01:54,875 --> 00:01:58,521
Qiziqarli ekan, koʻp yeyish kerak.

39
00:01:58,545 --> 00:02:00,345
Ha.

40
00:02:00,368 --> 00:02:03,901
Koʻproq oqib kelmasa-chi?

41
00:02:03,924 --> 00:02:08,994
Doʻkon xodimi tayyorlayapti, biroz kutib turing.

42
00:02:09,018 --> 00:02:11,109
Tushunarli.

43
00:02:11,132 --> 00:02:14,332
Qoshiqni olib, tayyorman.

44
00:02:14,355 --> 00:02:23,364
Bugungi video skriptini tavsif qismidan va eng yaxshi izohdan yuklab olish mumkin.

45
00:02:23,364 --> 00:02:24,864
2-qism: Hiyashi chuka (sovuq ramen)ni qanday iste’mol qilish kerak / Hiyashi Chuka (sovuq ramen)ni qanday yeyish kerak

46
00:02:24,864 --> 00:02:27,997
Bugun juda issiq ekan-ku.

47
00:02:28,020 --> 00:02:30,053
Ha, shunday.

48
00:02:30,076 --> 00:02:32,495
Qorni ochdi.

49
00:02:32,519 --> 00:02:36,530
Doʻkondan hiyashi chuka sotib oldim.

50
00:02:36,553 --> 00:02:39,003
Hiyashi chuka degani?

51
00:02:39,026 --> 00:02:41,360
Juda mazali koʻrinadi.

52
00:02:41,384 --> 00:02:44,022
Endi, yeyishni boshlaymiz!

53
00:02:44,046 --> 00:02:45,446
Eee?

54
00:02:45,469 --> 00:02:49,402
Sumkada juda koʻp narsa bor ekan.

55
00:02:49,425 --> 00:02:52,992
Ha, shoʻrva va masalliqlar bor.

56
00:02:53,015 --> 00:02:55,711
Bu suvmi?

57
00:02:55,734 --> 00:02:59,782
Bu — lagʻmonni ajratish uchun suv.

58
00:02:59,805 --> 00:03:02,475
Lagʻmonni yuvamizmi?

59
00:03:02,499 --> 00:03:05,910
Yoʻq, yuvmaymiz.

60
00:03:05,934 --> 00:03:08,341
Lagʻmon ustiga quyamiz.

61
00:03:08,364 --> 00:03:10,901
Keyin aralashtiramiz.

62
00:03:10,925 --> 00:03:12,725
Tushunarli.

63
00:03:12,748 --> 00:03:15,589
Avval suvni quyish kerak ekan.

64
00:03:15,613 --> 00:03:17,089
Ha.

65
00:03:17,112 --> 00:03:20,748
Keyin shoʻrvadan quyasiz.

66
00:03:20,771 --> 00:03:23,304
Shoʻrva quyildi.

67
00:03:23,327 --> 00:03:26,094
Endi nima qilamiz?

68
00:03:26,117 --> 00:03:29,334
Masalliqlarni lagʻmon ustiga qoʻying.

69
00:03:29,358 --> 00:03:32,891
Vetchina, tuxum va bodring, shundaymi?

70
00:03:32,914 --> 00:03:35,789
Juda chiroyli chiqdi!

71
00:03:35,812 --> 00:03:39,346
Bu xantal va mayonez.

72
00:03:39,369 --> 00:03:42,615
Mayonez ham solamizmi?

73
00:03:42,638 --> 00:03:45,205
Istasangiz soling.

74
00:03:45,227 --> 00:03:47,724
Men solaman.

75
00:03:47,748 --> 00:03:51,020
Men faqat xantal solaman.

76
00:03:51,043 --> 00:03:54,686
Yeyishdan oldin qilinadigan ishlar koʻp ekan-ku.

77
00:03:54,710 --> 00:03:57,127
Rostdan ham.

78
00:03:57,150 --> 00:04:01,165
Biroz qiyin jumboqdek.

79
00:04:01,189 --> 00:04:04,648
Ammo tayyorlash tugadi.

80
00:04:04,671 --> 00:04:07,604
Nihoyat yeyishimiz mumkin!

81
00:04:07,627 --> 00:04:09,227
Yeyishni boshlaymiz!

82
00:04:09,250 --> 00:04:11,650
Taʼmi qanday?

83
00:04:11,673 --> 00:04:15,207
Juda nordon va mazali!

84
00:04:15,230 --> 00:04:17,996
Salqinlashtiradi, shundaymi?

85
00:04:18,019 --> 00:04:21,186
Yoz uchun juda mos taom.

86
00:04:21,209 --> 00:04:22,542
Ha.

87
00:04:22,565 --> 00:04:25,299
Har kuni yeyishni xohlayman.

88
00:04:25,322 --> 00:04:29,090
Keyin boshqa doʻkondan narsa sotib olamiz.

89
00:04:29,113 --> 00:04:30,805
Yaxshi fikr!

90
00:04:30,829 --> 00:04:33,795
Yana birga yeyamiz!

91
00:04:33,818 --> 00:04:40,923
Bugungi videodagi mavzuni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori kommentariyda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

92
00:04:40,923 --> 00:04:42,423
3-qism: Yozgi festivalda muzqaymoq / Yozgi festivalda qirgʻichdan chiqarilgan muz

93
00:04:42,423 --> 00:04:46,096
Festival juda gavjum, shundaymi?

94
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:50,725
Ha, juda koʻp odam bor.

95
00:04:50,748 --> 00:04:55,282
Issiq, shuning uchun muzqaymoq sotib olamiz!

96
00:04:55,304 --> 00:04:57,238
Yaxshi fikr!

97
00:04:57,261 --> 00:05:00,753
U yerda doʻkoncha bor.

98
00:05:00,776 --> 00:05:03,071
Menyuga qarang.

99
00:05:03,095 --> 00:05:06,702
Juda koʻp turi bor ekan.

100
00:05:06,725 --> 00:05:10,960
Qulupnay, qovun, limon bor.

101
00:05:10,984 --> 00:05:15,184
U yerda „Koʻk Gavayi“ deb yozilgan.

102
00:05:15,207 --> 00:05:19,854
„Koʻk Gavayi“mi? Qanday taʼm?

103
00:05:19,878 --> 00:05:23,116
Keling, bu qanday ta'm ekanligini topamiz.

104
00:05:23,139 --> 00:05:25,413
Sinab ko'ring-ku.

105
00:05:25,436 --> 00:05:27,806
Bilmadim-ku.

106
00:05:27,829 --> 00:05:31,163
Men „Koʻk Gavayi“ni tanlayman.

107
00:05:31,187 --> 00:05:34,066
Men esa qulupnayni tanlayman.

108
00:05:34,090 --> 00:05:37,762
Kechirasiz, shuni va shuni bering.

109
00:05:37,785 --> 00:05:42,230
Koʻk qor muz, juda chiroyli ekan-ku!

110
00:05:42,254 --> 00:05:46,094
Ha, sovuq va mazali.

111
00:05:46,117 --> 00:05:48,850
Qanday ta'm bermoqda?

112
00:05:48,873 --> 00:05:51,407
Hmm, shirin ekan.

113
00:05:51,430 --> 00:05:54,900
Lekin qulupnay bilan bir xil ta'm.

114
00:05:54,923 --> 00:05:57,292
Rostdanmi?

115
00:05:57,315 --> 00:06:01,370
Mening „Koʻk Gavayi“imni sinab ko'ring.

116
00:06:01,394 --> 00:06:04,692
Vay! Bir xil ta'm ekan-ku.

117
00:06:04,716 --> 00:06:10,925
Aslida, qor muz siroplarining hammasi bir xil ta'mda bo'ladi.

118
00:06:10,948 --> 00:06:13,589
Ha, shundaymi?

119
00:06:13,613 --> 00:06:16,046
Ishonmayman-ku.

120
00:06:16,069 --> 00:06:19,754
Faqat rangi va hidigina farq qiladi.

121
00:06:19,778 --> 00:06:22,456
Bu haqiqatan hayratlanarli fakt ekan!

122
00:06:22,479 --> 00:06:24,517
Bilmasdim-ku.

123
00:06:24,540 --> 00:06:29,507
Lekin koʻk rang yozga mos kelib turibdi.

124
00:06:29,530 --> 00:06:31,343
Ha, shunday.

125
00:06:31,366 --> 00:06:34,600
Bayram kayfiyatini uygʻotadi.

126
00:06:34,623 --> 00:06:37,656
Tilingiz koʻk rangga boʻyangan emasmi?

127
00:06:37,679 --> 00:06:40,325
Rostdanmi?

128
00:06:40,349 --> 00:06:42,949
Koʻzgu yoʻq-ku.

129
00:06:42,972 --> 00:06:46,372
Ha, juda koʻk ekan!

130
00:06:46,395 --> 00:06:48,694
Qiziqarli ekan-ku.

131
00:06:48,717 --> 00:06:52,493
Uyalaman, lekin qiziq.

132
00:06:52,516 --> 00:06:55,954
Yozning yaxshi xotirasiga aylandi-ku.

133
00:06:55,977 --> 00:07:00,247
Ha, qor muz yeb, yaxshi boʻldi.

134
00:07:00,271 --> 00:07:01,771
4-Sahna: Yozgi sigir kuni va ilonbaliq / Yozgi sigir kuni va ilonbaliq

135
00:07:01,771 --> 00:07:07,269
Oʻsha doʻkon oldida juda koʻp odamlar navbatda turibdi.

136
00:07:07,292 --> 00:07:09,067
Rostdan ham.

137
00:07:09,090 --> 00:07:11,325
Qanday doʻkon bu?

138
00:07:11,349 --> 00:07:14,085
Ilonbaliq doʻkoni ekan.

139
00:07:14,108 --> 00:07:16,186
Ilonbaliqmi?

140
00:07:16,210 --> 00:07:19,067
Qimmatbaho baliq ekan-ku.

141
00:07:19,090 --> 00:07:22,986
Bugun yozgi sigir kuni ekan.

142
00:07:23,010 --> 00:07:26,050
Yozgi sigir kunimi?

143
00:07:26,073 --> 00:07:27,968
Bu nima?

144
00:07:27,991 --> 00:07:31,058
Yozning maxsus kuni.

145
00:07:31,081 --> 00:07:34,014
Barcha odamlar ilonbaliq yeydi.

146
00:07:34,037 --> 00:07:37,892
Nega yozda ilonbaliq yeyishadi?

147
00:07:37,916 --> 00:07:42,449
Ilonbaliq yeb, kuch-quvvat olinadi.

148
00:07:42,472 --> 00:07:45,406
Issiq yozga chidash uchun, shundaymi?

149
00:07:45,430 --> 00:07:48,004
Ha, shunday.

150
00:07:48,028 --> 00:07:50,828
Yaponiyaning qadimiy madaniyati ekan.

151
00:07:50,851 --> 00:07:53,184
Qiziqarli ekan-ku.

152
00:07:53,207 --> 00:07:56,007
Biz ham navbatga turamiz.

153
00:07:56,030 --> 00:07:58,528
Menyu bor ekan-ku.

154
00:07:58,552 --> 00:08:00,186
Qarang.

155
00:08:00,209 --> 00:08:04,575
„Shox“, „Bambuk“, „Olma“ deb yozilgan.

156
00:08:04,598 --> 00:08:06,435
Bu nima?

157
00:08:06,458 --> 00:08:08,992
Darajalar haqida.

158
00:08:09,015 --> 00:08:12,026
Eng yuqorisi — „Mats“ (qaragʻay).

159
00:08:12,049 --> 00:08:15,683
Narxlari butunlay farq qiladi, shunday emasmi?

160
00:08:15,706 --> 00:08:17,985
Nima farqi bor?

161
00:08:18,008 --> 00:08:21,842
Ilonbaliqning miqdori va hajmi farq qiladi.

162
00:08:21,865 --> 00:08:25,718
Men eng arzon „Ume“ (olcha)ni tanlayman.

163
00:08:25,741 --> 00:08:29,741
Men esa hashamat qilib „Mats“ni tanlayman.

164
00:08:29,764 --> 00:08:31,297
Ha?

165
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:33,218
„Mats“mi?

166
00:08:33,241 --> 00:08:35,574
Ajoyib!

167
00:08:35,597 --> 00:08:40,431
Bir soat navbat turdim, shuning uchun koʻp yeyishni xohlayman.

168
00:08:40,454 --> 00:08:44,022
A, stolga oʻtirishga taklif qilindi.

169
00:08:44,045 --> 00:08:47,112
Maʼlum bir yaxshi hid kelib turibdi.

170
00:08:47,135 --> 00:08:49,535
Ilonbaliq keldi.

171
00:08:49,558 --> 00:08:52,691
Juda mazali koʻrinibdi.

172
00:08:52,714 --> 00:08:55,647
Yumshoq va mazali ekan.

173
00:08:55,670 --> 00:08:57,880
Kuch-quvvat keladi.

174
00:08:57,903 --> 00:09:01,737
„Ume“ ham yetarlicha katta va mazali.

175
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:04,993
Sosning taʼmi ajoyib ekan.

176
00:09:05,016 --> 00:09:07,694
Guruchni tez yediradi.

177
00:09:07,718 --> 00:09:11,119
Shu bilan bu yoz ham hech narsadan qoʻrqmaymiz.

178
00:09:11,143 --> 00:09:12,720
Ha.

179
00:09:12,743 --> 00:09:16,318
Ertadan yana qattiq ishlaymiz.

180
00:09:16,342 --> 00:09:18,709
Yoqimli ovqat boʻldi.

181
00:09:18,732 --> 00:09:21,532
Keyingi yil yana kelishni istayman.

182
00:09:21,555 --> 00:09:23,055
5-sahna: Izakaya zavqlari / The Joys of Izakaya

183
00:09:23,055 --> 00:09:27,055
Yaponiyaning izakayasi juda qiziqarli ekan.

184
00:09:27,078 --> 00:09:32,678
Ha, menyuda koʻp narsa bor, tanlash qiyin.

185
00:09:32,701 --> 00:09:37,668
Avval ichimlik va edamame (yashil loviya) buyurtma qilamiz.

186
00:09:37,691 --> 00:09:40,024
Edamamemi?

187
00:09:40,047 --> 00:09:43,580
U yashil rangli sabzavotmi?

188
00:09:43,603 --> 00:09:48,642
Ha, tez chiqadi, yaxshi tanlov.

189
00:09:48,665 --> 00:09:51,432
A, keldi-ku!

190
00:09:51,455 --> 00:09:54,388
Hammasi juda tez.

191
00:09:54,411 --> 00:09:57,811
Sovuq pivo bilan juda mos keladi.

192
00:09:57,834 --> 00:10:00,634
Juda mazali koʻrinadi.

193
00:10:00,657 --> 00:10:03,730
Keling, boshlaymiz.

194
00:10:03,754 --> 00:10:06,287
A, biroz kutib turing.

195
00:10:06,310 --> 00:10:09,409
Qobigʻi bilan yemang.

196
00:10:09,432 --> 00:10:10,704
Ha?

197
00:10:10,727 --> 00:10:13,861
Qobigʻini yeb boʻlmaydimi?

198
00:10:13,884 --> 00:10:19,350
Ha, qobigʻi qattiq boʻladi, yeb boʻlmaydi.

199
00:10:19,373 --> 00:10:21,753
Bilmasdim-ku.

200
00:10:21,776 --> 00:10:24,435
Deyarli xato qilardim.

201
00:10:24,459 --> 00:10:29,494
Barmoq bilan bosib, ichidagi loviyani chiqarib yeying.

202
00:10:29,517 --> 00:10:31,372
Shundaymi?

203
00:10:31,395 --> 00:10:34,595
A, loviya chiqdi.

204
00:10:34,618 --> 00:10:37,185
Shunday.

205
00:10:37,208 --> 00:10:39,008
Juda yaxshi qilyapsiz.

206
00:10:39,031 --> 00:10:42,768
A, juda mazali ekan!

207
00:10:42,792 --> 00:10:46,289
Tuzining taʼmi juda mos kelgan, shundaymi?

208
00:10:46,313 --> 00:10:47,999
Ha.

209
00:10:48,022 --> 00:10:51,680
Bu pivo ichishni tezlashtiradi.

210
00:10:51,703 --> 00:10:54,705
Qoʻlingiz toʻxtamaydi, shundaymi?

211
00:10:54,729 --> 00:10:57,107
Rostdan ham.

212
00:10:57,130 --> 00:11:00,863
Hammasini allaqachon yeb boʻldim.

213
00:11:00,886 --> 00:11:03,944
Yana bir portion buyurtma qilaymi?

214
00:11:03,968 --> 00:11:06,534
Ha, iltimos.

215
00:11:06,557 --> 00:11:10,624
Keyin men tozalab beraman.

216
00:11:10,647 --> 00:11:15,981
Mazali va sogʻlom boʻlsa, koʻp yeysan boʻladi-ku.

217
00:11:16,005 --> 00:11:19,805
Mening mamlakatimda bunday ovqat kam uchraydi.

218
00:11:19,828 --> 00:11:23,161
Chet ellarda ham mashhur boʻlishi mumkin.

219
00:11:23,184 --> 00:11:24,857
Ha, shunday.

220
00:11:24,881 --> 00:11:28,288
Yapon madaniyatining tavsiya etilgan jihati.

221
00:11:28,311 --> 00:11:31,386
Doʻstlarimga ham aytib qoʻyishim kerak.

222
00:11:31,410 --> 00:11:34,543
Poʻstini yemaslik kerak, desangiz.

223
00:11:34,566 --> 00:11:38,333
Bu juda muhim maslahat ekan.

224
00:11:38,356 --> 00:11:41,689
Keyingi menyu nima boʻlsin?

225
00:11:41,712 --> 00:11:44,196
Yakitori (grill qilingan tovuq) buyurtma qilaylik.

226
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:46,553
Yaxshi fikr!

227
00:11:46,576 --> 00:11:50,057
Izakaya kechasi – eng zoʻri!

228
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,580
6-SAHNA: Tarvuz tanlash suhbati / Tarvuz tanlash: Suhbat

229
00:11:51,580 --> 00:11:54,114
Supermarketga boring.

230
00:11:54,137 --> 00:11:55,870
Yaxshi fikr!

231
00:11:55,893 --> 00:11:59,060
Meva sotib olmoqchiman.

232
00:11:59,083 --> 00:12:02,849
A, u yerda tarvuz bor ekan!

233
00:12:02,872 --> 00:12:07,306
Vov, bu tarvuz juda katta-ku!

234
00:12:07,329 --> 00:12:10,495
Butun holda sotilmoqda.

235
00:12:10,518 --> 00:12:12,785
Narxini koʻrib chiqing.

236
00:12:12,809 --> 00:12:15,049
Juda qimmat ekan.

237
00:12:15,073 --> 00:12:18,606
Mening mamlakatimda bundan arzonroq.

238
00:12:18,629 --> 00:12:22,473
Yaponiyada tarvuz biroz qimmatroq.

239
00:12:22,496 --> 00:12:26,363
Ushbu tarvuz sovutgichga sigʻmaydi.

240
00:12:26,386 --> 00:12:28,405
Ha, shunday.

241
00:12:28,429 --> 00:12:32,596
Shuning uchun kichikroq tarvuz sotib olamiz.

242
00:12:32,619 --> 00:12:36,652
A, bu yerda kesilgan tarvuz bor ekan.

243
00:12:36,675 --> 00:12:41,010
Bu arzonroq va sovutgichga sigʻadi.

244
00:12:41,033 --> 00:12:44,067
Yaxshi, shuni olamiz.

245
00:12:44,090 --> 00:12:46,493
Uyga qaytib, yeyishni boshlaymiz.

246
00:12:46,516 --> 00:12:49,949
Endi tarvuz tayyor.

247
00:12:49,972 --> 00:12:51,839
Marhamat.

248
00:12:51,862 --> 00:12:53,742
Rahmat.

249
00:12:53,765 --> 00:12:56,011
Juda mazali koʻrinadi.

250
00:12:56,035 --> 00:12:59,905
Yeyishdan oldin bu sepib qoʻying.

251
00:12:59,928 --> 00:13:02,095
Bu nima?

252
00:13:02,118 --> 00:13:05,185
Tuz.

253
00:13:05,209 --> 00:13:07,825
Tarvuzga tuz sepamiz.

254
00:13:07,848 --> 00:13:09,082
E?

255
00:13:09,106 --> 00:13:12,883
Tarvuzga tuz sepish kerakmi?

256
00:13:12,906 --> 00:13:16,597
Tarvuz shirin ovqat, shunday emasmi?

257
00:13:16,620 --> 00:13:19,587
Nega tuz sepish kerak?

258
00:13:19,610 --> 00:13:24,108
Tuz sepilsa, yanada shirinroq boʻladi.

259
00:13:24,131 --> 00:13:26,064
Rostdanmi?

260
00:13:26,087 --> 00:13:28,287
Ishonmayman-ku.

261
00:13:28,310 --> 00:13:32,244
Ishonmagan boʻlsangiz ham, sinab koʻring.

262
00:13:32,267 --> 00:13:34,200
Tushunarli.

263
00:13:34,223 --> 00:13:37,068
Biroz sepaman.

264
00:13:37,092 --> 00:13:39,063
Taʼmi qanday?

265
00:13:39,086 --> 00:13:42,623
A, rostdan ham shirinroq ekan-ku!

266
00:13:42,646 --> 00:13:45,653
Juda shirin boʻlib qoldi.

267
00:13:45,677 --> 00:13:49,210
Gʻalati, lekin mazali ekan.

268
00:13:49,233 --> 00:13:52,000
Yoqib qoldingiz, yaxshi boʻldi.

269
00:13:52,023 --> 00:13:54,556
Koʻp yeb qoʻying.

270
00:13:54,579 --> 00:13:56,312
Ha.

271
00:13:56,335 --> 00:14:00,902
Yapon madaniyati juda qiziqarli ekan, shunday emasmi?

272
00:14:00,925 --> 00:14:02,425
7-Sahna: Retro sayohat va Ramune ichish usuli / Retro manzaralar va Ramune ichish siri

273
00:14:02,425 --> 00:14:07,239
Bugun retro uslubidagi sayyohlik joylariga keldik-ku.

274
00:14:07,263 --> 00:14:10,130
Qandolatchilik doʻkoni bor ekan.

275
00:14:10,153 --> 00:14:11,953
Kiring.

276
00:14:11,976 --> 00:14:15,670
Vay, sovuq Ramune sotilayapti.

277
00:14:15,693 --> 00:14:17,826
Ramune deysizmi?

278
00:14:17,849 --> 00:14:21,226
Shisha butilka juda chiroyli ekan-ku.

279
00:14:21,250 --> 00:14:22,984
Sotib olaylik.

280
00:14:23,007 --> 00:14:25,092
Marhamat, oling.

281
00:14:25,116 --> 00:14:26,849
Rahmat.

282
00:14:26,872 --> 00:14:30,719
Qanday qilib ichamiz?

283
00:14:30,742 --> 00:14:33,709
Qopqogʻi yoʻq-ku.

284
00:14:33,732 --> 00:14:37,732
Plastik qopqoqni bosing.

285
00:14:37,755 --> 00:14:39,688
Bu yerini bosaymi?

286
00:14:39,711 --> 00:14:44,121
A, ichida sharcha tushdi.

287
00:14:44,145 --> 00:14:45,982
Shunday.

288
00:14:46,005 --> 00:14:50,491
Sharcha ichida boʻlsa, ichish mumkin boʻladi.

289
00:14:50,515 --> 00:14:53,248
Juda qiziqarli mexanizm ekan-ku.

290
00:14:53,271 --> 00:14:56,604
Keling, boshlaymiz.

291
00:14:56,627 --> 00:15:00,227
A, sharbat chiqmayapti.

292
00:15:00,250 --> 00:15:03,926
Butilkani qattiq qiya qildingizmi?

293
00:15:03,950 --> 00:15:07,483
Ha, qattiq qiya qildim.

294
00:15:07,506 --> 00:15:09,959
Lekin chiqmayapti.

295
00:15:09,983 --> 00:15:15,881
A, ichidagi sharcha ogʻizga tiqilib qolgan-ku.

296
00:15:15,904 --> 00:15:19,870
Rostdan ham tiqilib qolgan.

297
00:15:19,893 --> 00:15:22,227
Nima qilsak boʻladi?

298
00:15:22,250 --> 00:15:27,666
Butilka ogʻzida bir oz botib turgan joy bor.

299
00:15:27,689 --> 00:15:30,456
Botib turgan joy deysizmi?

300
00:15:30,479 --> 00:15:33,045
A, mana bu joy ekan.

301
00:15:33,068 --> 00:15:36,526
Sharchani shu yerga ilintiring.

302
00:15:36,550 --> 00:15:38,283
Tushunarli.

303
00:15:38,306 --> 00:15:41,515
Sharchani shu yerda ushlab turaman.

304
00:15:41,539 --> 00:15:45,139
Shunda sharcha tushib ketmaydi.

305
00:15:45,162 --> 00:15:47,815
Qilib koʻray.

306
00:15:47,838 --> 00:15:50,604
A, chiqdi!

307
00:15:50,627 --> 00:15:52,903
Ichishga muvaffaq boʻldingizmi?

308
00:15:52,927 --> 00:15:55,261
Yaxshi boʻldi.

309
00:15:55,284 --> 00:16:00,140
Ha, juda mazali gazlangan ichimlik ekan.

310
00:16:00,163 --> 00:16:05,097
Lekin ichish biroz qiyin ekan-ku.

311
00:16:05,121 --> 00:16:07,773
Kuch talab qiladigan narsa ekan.

312
00:16:07,796 --> 00:16:10,964
Odatsangiz, oson boʻladi.

313
00:16:10,988 --> 00:16:15,521
Sharcha shangillab turgan tovushi juda chiroyli ekan.

314
00:16:15,544 --> 00:16:18,559
Yozning ovozi eshitilayapti-ku.

315
00:16:18,583 --> 00:16:23,616
Ha, Yapon yozini his qilayapman.

316
00:16:23,639 --> 00:16:26,093
Yana bir dona sotib olaylikmi?

317
00:16:26,117 --> 00:16:28,127
Yaxshi fikr!

318
00:16:28,151 --> 00:16:31,951
Keyinroq yaxshi ichishim mumkin deb oʻylayman.

319
00:16:31,974 --> 00:16:33,474
8-Sahna: Daryo ustidagi yozgi ovqatlanish – Hamo taomini tatib koʻrish / Daryo ustida yozgi ovqatlanish: Hamo taomini tatib koʻrish

320
00:16:33,474 --> 00:16:37,725
Kioto yozida juda issiq boʻladi-ku.

321
00:16:37,748 --> 00:16:39,882
Ha, shunday.

322
00:16:39,905 --> 00:16:43,842
Lekin bu yerda salqin ekan.

323
00:16:43,865 --> 00:16:48,799
Ha, daryo ustida restoran bor ekan.

324
00:16:48,822 --> 00:16:52,756
Bunga „daryo ustidagi stol“ deyiladi.

325
00:16:52,779 --> 00:16:57,272
Daryo suvi koʻrinib, juda chiroyli ekan.

326
00:16:57,296 --> 00:17:00,496
Shamol juda yoqimli esayapti-ku.

327
00:17:00,518 --> 00:17:04,328
Keling, taomlar keldi!

328
00:17:04,352 --> 00:17:07,685
Bu juda chiroyli oq baliq ekan, shunday emasmi?

329
00:17:07,708 --> 00:17:10,042
Bu nima?

330
00:17:10,065 --> 00:17:14,031
Bu baliqning nomi „hamo“.

331
00:17:14,054 --> 00:17:17,621
Bu yozning hashamatli baliqlaridan biri.

332
00:17:17,644 --> 00:17:19,244
„Hamo“ debmi?

333
00:17:19,267 --> 00:17:22,000
Bunday nomni ilk bor eshitayapman.

334
00:17:22,023 --> 00:17:26,657
Issiq suvda pishirilgan, „yu-biki“ deb ataladi.

335
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:30,046
Olxoʻri sousiga botirib yeying.

336
00:17:30,069 --> 00:17:32,313
Juda mazali koʻrinadi.

337
00:17:32,337 --> 00:17:34,138
Yeyishni boshlaymiz!

338
00:17:34,162 --> 00:17:39,295
Bu baliqda suyak yoʻqmi, nimaga?

339
00:17:39,318 --> 00:17:43,751
Yoʻq, aslida juda koʻp suyagi bor.

340
00:17:43,774 --> 00:17:48,647
Ha? Koʻp suyagi bor ekanmi?

341
00:17:48,671 --> 00:17:50,071
Ha.

342
00:17:50,094 --> 00:17:53,694
Ammo xavotir olmang.

343
00:17:53,717 --> 00:17:59,484
Ustalar suyaklarni maydalab, pichoq bilan kesib qoʻyishadi.

344
00:17:59,507 --> 00:18:02,313
Suyaklarni ham kesishadi?

345
00:18:02,336 --> 00:18:03,993
Ha.

346
00:18:04,016 --> 00:18:08,550
Bu „suyak kesish“ deb ataladigan maxsus texnika.

347
00:18:08,573 --> 00:18:13,706
Shuning uchun suyaklari boʻlsa ham, shunchaki yeb qoʻyishingiz mumkin.

348
00:18:13,729 --> 00:18:16,496
Ajoyib texnika ekan!

349
00:18:16,518 --> 00:18:19,165
Endi yeyaylik.

350
00:18:19,189 --> 00:18:23,859
Vov, juda yumshoq ekan!

351
00:18:23,883 --> 00:18:27,250
Suyaklari umuman sezilmayapti.

352
00:18:27,273 --> 00:18:29,113
Yaxshi boʻldi.

353
00:18:29,136 --> 00:18:32,469
Olxoʻri sousi juda mos tushdi.

354
00:18:32,492 --> 00:18:34,026
Ha.

355
00:18:34,048 --> 00:18:38,382
Yengil va juda mazali ekan.

356
00:18:38,405 --> 00:18:41,571
Yoz uchun aynan mos baliq.

357
00:18:41,594 --> 00:18:46,330
Kyoto madaniyatining goʻzalligini bilib oldim.

358
00:18:46,354 --> 00:18:51,187
Manzara ham chiroyli, taom ham ajoyib.

359
00:18:51,210 --> 00:18:54,879
Meni olib kelganingiz uchun raxmat.

360
00:18:54,902 --> 00:19:00,469
Yoʻq, hali ham juda koʻp mazali taomlar bor.

361
00:19:00,492 --> 00:19:02,459
Kutgandayman!

362
00:19:02,482 --> 00:19:05,316
Sekin-asta yeyishni davom ettiramiz.

363
00:19:05,339 --> 00:19:06,839
9-sahna: Qahvaxonada kutilmagan uchrashuv

364
00:19:06,839 --> 00:19:11,639
Issiqda koʻp yurib qoldingiz, shunday emasmi?

365
00:19:11,662 --> 00:19:15,906
Ha, juda chanqadim.

366
00:19:15,930 --> 00:19:19,063
Bu doʻkon ichiga kiramiz.

367
00:19:19,086 --> 00:19:21,102
Yaxshi fikr!

368
00:19:21,126 --> 00:19:23,340
Salqin ekan.

369
00:19:23,363 --> 00:19:26,763
Qarang, choy keldi!

370
00:19:26,786 --> 00:19:31,052
Vov, sovuq ichimlik ekan!

371
00:19:31,075 --> 00:19:34,209
Jigarrang rangda.

372
00:19:34,232 --> 00:19:39,466
Omad, muzli kofeni bepul berishdi!

373
00:19:39,489 --> 00:19:43,059
Ha? Muzli kofe?

374
00:19:43,083 --> 00:19:49,416
Ha, mening mamlakatimda bu rang kofe degani.

375
00:19:49,439 --> 00:19:51,773
Ichayapman!

376
00:19:51,796 --> 00:19:55,196
Gulp gulp.

377
00:19:55,219 --> 00:19:56,425
Eee?

378
00:19:56,449 --> 00:19:59,908
Taʼmi butunlay boshqacha ekan.

379
00:19:59,931 --> 00:20:02,131
Achchiq emasmi?

380
00:20:02,154 --> 00:20:04,355
Shirin emasmi?

381
00:20:04,378 --> 00:20:09,391
Ha, na achchiq, na shirin.

382
00:20:09,415 --> 00:20:12,262
Bu kofe emas-ku!

383
00:20:12,285 --> 00:20:15,918
Bu „mugicha“ deb ataladigan choy.

384
00:20:15,941 --> 00:20:20,708
Yapon oshxonalarida yozda koʻp beriladi.

385
00:20:20,731 --> 00:20:23,664
Bepul ichish mumkin ekan-ku.

386
00:20:23,687 --> 00:20:27,257
Bepul ekanligi juda yoqimli.

387
00:20:27,281 --> 00:20:29,287
Mugichoymi?

388
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:32,110
Buni birinchi marta ichdim.

389
00:20:32,133 --> 00:20:35,975
Serin va tomoqni namlaydi.

390
00:20:35,998 --> 00:20:40,198
Kofeinsiz, shuning uchun sog‘lom.

391
00:20:40,221 --> 00:20:42,622
Shunday ekan-ku.

392
00:20:42,645 --> 00:20:45,979
Juda ichishga qulay.

393
00:20:46,002 --> 00:20:51,301
Ayran qahva ichishni xohlardim, lekin bu ham yaxshi.

394
00:20:51,324 --> 00:20:53,757
Yoqdimi?

395
00:20:53,780 --> 00:20:55,747
Yaxshi bo‘ldi.

396
00:20:55,770 --> 00:21:00,570
Muz ko‘p solingan, juda sovuq.

397
00:21:00,593 --> 00:21:04,593
Kechirasiz, yana bir piyola bering.

398
00:21:04,616 --> 00:21:07,470
Ko‘p iching!

399
00:21:07,493 --> 00:21:08,826
Ha.

400
00:21:08,849 --> 00:21:13,493
Yaponiyaning yozida mugichoy kerak ekan.

401
00:21:13,516 --> 00:21:16,749
Endi buyurtma beramiz.

402
00:21:16,772 --> 00:21:19,106
Nima yeymoqchisiz?

403
00:21:19,129 --> 00:21:22,411
Sovuq udon yeyishni xohlayman.

404
00:21:22,434 --> 00:21:23,934
10-sahna: Qaynoq jazirama kunidagi achchiq karri / Juda issiq kunning achchiq karri taomi

405
00:21:23,934 --> 00:21:29,074
Bugun haqiqatan ham juda issiq kun ekan-ku.

406
00:21:29,097 --> 00:21:33,830
Quyosh shunchalik kuchliki, erib ketgandek his qilinyapti.

407
00:21:33,853 --> 00:21:37,747
Bunday kunlarda bu do‘konga boring.

408
00:21:37,771 --> 00:21:40,138
Karri do‘konimi?

409
00:21:40,161 --> 00:21:43,197
Juda yaxshi hid kelayapti-ku.

410
00:21:43,221 --> 00:21:48,089
Ha, bu yerda achchiq karri mashhur.

411
00:21:48,112 --> 00:21:51,245
E, achchiqmi?

412
00:21:51,268 --> 00:21:54,035
Karri qizil rangda ekan-ku.

413
00:21:54,058 --> 00:21:57,946
Ha, juda achchiq.

414
00:21:57,970 --> 00:22:00,349
Kuting.

415
00:22:00,373 --> 00:22:04,307
Bunday issiq kunlarda...

416
00:22:04,330 --> 00:22:08,530
Nega issiq va achchiq narsalarni yeymoqchisiz? Yanada issiqroq bo‘ladi-ku.

417
00:22:08,553 --> 00:22:11,529
Yana ham issiqroq bo‘ladi.

418
00:22:11,552 --> 00:22:16,430
Achchiq narsalarni yegan sari, ko‘p terlaymiz.

419
00:22:16,454 --> 00:22:22,221
Terlaganimizdan keyin tanamiz salqinlashadi.

420
00:22:22,244 --> 00:22:27,584
Yaponiyada yozda achchiq narsalarni ko‘p odamlar yeydi.

421
00:22:27,607 --> 00:22:30,376
Kuch-quvvat beradi-ku.

422
00:22:30,399 --> 00:22:32,566
Rostdanmi?

423
00:22:32,589 --> 00:22:35,122
Yolg‘ondek tuyuladi.

424
00:22:35,145 --> 00:22:37,745
Lekin tushunarli.

425
00:22:37,768 --> 00:22:39,972
Sinab ko‘raman.

426
00:22:39,996 --> 00:22:42,573
Karri keldi-ku!

427
00:22:42,596 --> 00:22:44,396
Marhamat.

428
00:22:44,419 --> 00:22:49,352
Vov, hidi bilan ham ter chiqayapti.

429
00:22:49,375 --> 00:22:51,508
Yeyishni boshlaymiz!

430
00:22:51,531 --> 00:22:55,098
Q, qattiq achchiq ekan!

431
00:22:55,121 --> 00:22:57,354
Suv iching.

432
00:22:57,377 --> 00:22:59,990
Y, yaxshimisiz?

433
00:23:00,014 --> 00:23:03,814
Suv ichganimdan keyin ham achchiq.

434
00:23:03,837 --> 00:23:06,837
Og‘zim og‘riyapti.

435
00:23:06,860 --> 00:23:10,661
Lekin qoshiq to‘xtamayapti-ku.

436
00:23:10,684 --> 00:23:12,451
Ha.

437
00:23:12,474 --> 00:23:15,074
Achchiq ekan!

438
00:23:15,097 --> 00:23:19,064
Lekin juda mazali.

439
00:23:19,087 --> 00:23:22,253
Umidli ta’m bor-ku.

440
00:23:22,276 --> 00:23:25,876
Peshonamdan ter tomchilab oqmoqda.

441
00:23:25,899 --> 00:23:28,466
Juda yoqimli, shunday emasmi?

442
00:23:28,489 --> 00:23:30,226
Ha.

443
00:23:30,250 --> 00:23:34,135
G'alati, lekin endi ancha yengil his qilyapman.

444
00:23:34,159 --> 00:23:39,434
Qara, do'kondan chiqibsizmi, salqinroq bo'ladi.

445
00:23:39,457 --> 00:23:41,702
Rostdan ham.

446
00:23:41,726 --> 00:23:45,328
Oldingiga qaraganda issiq emasdek tuyulmoqda.

447
00:23:45,351 --> 00:23:49,370
Yozgi achchiq karri – ajoyib narsa, shunday emasmi?

448
00:23:49,394 --> 00:23:51,401
Ha.

449
00:23:51,424 --> 00:23:54,791
Bu menga odat bo'lib qoladidek.

450
00:23:54,814 --> 00:23:57,092
Yana kelamiz.